        }
      ],
      "message": "wallet: fix migration of watch-only wallets\n\nWhen the wallet being migrated has no spendable material,\nApplyMigrationData() asserts that no records are left behind in it. The\naddress book half of that check works because DelAddressBookWithDB()\nerases from m_address_book straight away. The transaction half cannot:\nRemoveTxs() only erases the records from disk and defers the mapWallet\nremoval to the db txn's on_commit listener, which runs after\nApplyMigrationData() has returned.\n\nmapWallet is therefore never empty at that point, so migrating a\nwatch-only wallet that has transactions always failed with\n\"Error: Not all transaction records were migrated\".\n\nDiscount the transactions queued for deletion instead.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "yusufyildiz34",
        "email": "yusufyildiz86@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-10-20T11:32:00Z"
      },
